**Bug Analysis:**

The variable `i` is declared and initialized to 0 but never used (it stays 0 forever). The code uses `h[i]` which always checks `h[0]` (the first character of the remaining string `h`). When a match is found, it removes the first character with `h.Remove(0, 1)`.

