The first bus from B departs at `trafficBegin` (300), then every `b` minutes.

For a time `t` to be a valid bus departure from B: `(t - trafficBegin) % b == 0` and `t >= trafficBegin`.

So the first approaching bus >= `approachingTrafficBegin` (exclusive lower bound `tripBegin - tb`):

```csharp
var lowerBound = tripBegin - tb + 1; // strictly greater than tripBegin - tb
var upperBound = tripBegin + ta - 1; // strictly less than tripBegin + ta
```

Then find first valid bus time >= max(lowerBound, 300):

```csharp
using System;

public class Program
{
    public static void Main()
    {
        var input = Console.ReadLine().Split(' ');
        var a = int.Parse(input[0]);
        var ta = int.Parse(input[1]);
        input = Console.ReadLine().Split(' ');
        var b = int.Parse(input[0]);
        var tb = int.Parse(input[1]);
        input = Console.ReadLine().Split(':');

        var tripBegin = int.Parse(input[0])*60 + int.Parse(input[1]);
        var trafficBegin = 5*60;
        var trafficEnd = 23*60 + 59;

        // Strict inequalities: tripBegin - tb < t < tripBegin + ta
        var lowerBound = tripBegin - tb + 1; // t >= lowerBound means t > tripBegin - tb
        var upperBound = tripBegin + ta - 1; // t <= upperBound means t < tripBegin + ta

        var searchFrom = Math.Max(lowerBound, trafficBegin);
        var searchTo = Math.Min(upperBound, trafficEnd);

        if (searchTo < searchFrom)
        {
            Console.WriteLine(0);
            return;
        }

        // First bus from B at trafficBegin, then every b minutes
        int offset = (searchFrom - trafficBegin) % b;
        int firstBus = offset == 0 ? searchFrom : searchFrom + (b - offset);

        var count = 0;
        if (searchTo >= firstBus)
            count = (searchTo - firstBus) / b + 1;

        Console.WriteLine(count);
    }
}
```

Checking example 2: a=60, ta=120, b=24, tb=100, tripBegin=780 (13:00)
- lowerBound = 780-100+1 = 681, upperBound = 780+120-1 = 899
- searchFrom = max(681, 300) = 681, searchTo = min(899, 1439) = 899
- offset = (681-300)%24 = 381%24 = 381-15*24=381-360=21, firstBus = 681+(24-21)=684
- count = (899-684)/24 + 1 = 215/24 + 1 = 8+1 = 9 ✓

