- Also consider `j=0` case in final max computation (which is all plain buns)

Let me also reconsider the final loop - we want max over all i of `dp[i,m] + ((n-i)/cTesto)*dTesto`. The current code loops j from 1 to m but should use j=m only (the final column after all stuffings considered), and also handle j=0.

Actually the simplest fix: add k=0 case by initializing `dp[i,j] = dp[i,j-1]` at start of inner loop, and in final max loop use `j=m` (or loop all j but also include j=0).

