Since all values are between 1-100, and we can only add attributes, we need to find `da` (added ATK), `dd` (added DEF), and `dh` (added HP) minimizing `da*ca + dd*cd + dh*ch`.

The key insight: ATK_Y only needs to go up to `DEF_M + 1` to `DEF_M + HP_M` (to deal any damage). DEF_Y only needs to go up to `ATK_M - 1` (to take 0 damage, making any HP sufficient).

